+### Building Specific Binaries
+
+You can build individual binaries instead of the full project:
+
+| Binary | Build Command | Description |
+|--------|---------------|-------------|
+| `llamafile` | `make o//llama.cpp/main/main` | Main CLI inference engine |
+| `llamafiler` | `make o//llamafile/server/main` | HTTP server with WebUI |
+| `llamafile-quantize` | `make o//llama.cpp/quantize/quantize` | Model quantization tool |
+| `llamafile-imatrix` | `make o//llama.cpp/imatrix/imatrix` | Importance matrix calculation |
+| `llamafile-bench` | `make o//llama.cpp/llama-bench/llama-bench` | Benchmarking tool |
+| `llamafile-perplexity` | `make o//llama.cpp/perplexity/perplexity` | Perplexity evaluation |
+| `llamafile-tokenize` | `make o//llamafile/tokenize` | Tokenization utility |
+| `llava-quantize` | `make o//llama.cpp/llava/llava-quantize` | Vision model quantization |
+| `zipalign` | `make o//llamafile/zipalign` | ZIP alignment utility |
+| `localscore` | `make o//localscore/localscore` | GPU/CPU benchmarking |
+| `whisperfile` | `make o//whisper.cpp/main` | Speech-to-text |
+| `sdfile` | `make o//stable-diffusion.cpp/main` | Image generation |
+
+Output binaries are placed in the `o//` directory (e.g., `o//llamafile/server/main`).
+
+### Build Modes
+
+The `MODE` variable (shorthand `m`) sets the output directory:
+
+```sh
+# Default mode - outputs to o//
+make o//llamafile/server/main
+
+# Named mode - outputs to o/release/
+make MODE=release o/release/llamafile/server/main
+# or using shorthand:
+make m=release o/release/llamafile/server/main
+
+# Debug mode - outputs to o/debug/
+make m=debug o/debug/llamafile/server/main
+```
+
+Note: The mode name only changes the output directory. Compiler flags
+remain the same by default (`-O2 -g`).
+
+### Customizing Compiler Flags
+
+Override flags on the command line:
+
+```sh
+# Debug build with no optimization
+make CCFLAGS="-O0 -g3" o//llamafile/server/main
+
+# Release build with maximum optimization
+make CCFLAGS="-O3 -DNDEBUG" m=release o/release/llamafile/server/main
+
+# Disable debug symbols
+make CCFLAGS="-O2" o//llama.cpp/main/main
+```
+
+Default compiler settings (from `build/config.mk`):
+
+| Variable | Default | Description |
+|----------|---------|-------------|
+| `CCFLAGS` | `-O2 -g -fexceptions -ffunction-sections -fdata-sections -mclang` | Common C/C++ flags |
+| `CXXFLAGS` | `-frtti -std=gnu++23` | C++ specific flags |
+| `TARGET_ARCH` | `-Xx86_64-mtune=znver4` | Architecture tuning |
+
+### Other Make Targets
+
+```sh
+# Run tests
+make check
+
+# Clean build artifacts
+make clean
+
+# Clean everything including cosmocc toolchain
+make distclean
+
+# Download/setup cosmocc toolchain only
+make cosmocc
+```
+
+### Parallel Builds
+
+Use `-j` for parallel compilation:
+
+```sh
+make -j$(nproc) o//llamafile/server/main   # Linux
+make -j$(sysctl -n hw.ncpu) o//llama.cpp/main/main  # macOS
+```
